From 4f133a0a72363041d352889d3dcd7cb283a7d755 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:20:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign the student portal UI

Make the student view feel less rigid and more like "Duolingo for the
kid", inside the Phase 1 palette (no red, navy text, sky and azure as
fills) with sun yellow added for stars only.

- New student shell: rounded Feather/Nunito headings, pressable 3D
  buttons and tiles, tab bar that stays on screen, messages sheet
  behind the bell.
- Home: state-based hero card, quiz tracker, practice card, Gap Map
  drawn as a learning path.
- Hand-in: photo tips, camera viewfinder, thumbnails with status,
  checking step, real photo picker with an in-browser sharpness check.
- Results: score ring, strengths and next steps, marks per question,
  step-by-step "How to fix it".
- Practice: pick then Check, feedback panel with a same-size-pieces
  drawing, Play again.
- Progress: score chart with list view, skill levels in words.
- Fix: reloading Hand in after sending no longer restarts the wizard.

Teacher and parent views are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GXURiyKXk9bjfXp43gcCuU
